> It is valid from 2023-01-10T10:00:00.00Z to 2023-01-25T10:00:00.00Z 
> which overlaps with the time range [2023-01-17T10:00:00.00Z, 
> 2023-01-30T10:00:00.00Z] of the query.
> 
