dsmmcken opened a new pull request, #567:
URL: https://github.com/apache/kafka-site/pull/567

   I've tried to leave this page better than how I found it:
   
   - For fairness, output is sorted alphabetically by root domain. The listing was quasi alphabetical, but looks like over time people have prepended and appended new companies into a now random order. Rather than re-sorting it once, and committing I've sorted the output by root domain (ie. eng.uber.com appears under U) such that list will always remain fair and orderly.
   - A few logos had an excessively large file size. Anything over 100kb has been resized, removing 1.5mb of page weight with no loss in quality as re-sized image are still 2x the displayed size.
   - Fixed a trailing space
   - Added Deephaven to the list


