Hey Andrew,

Thanks for the KIP. Just clarifying a couple small details.

1. I assume any broker can handle this API, so admin clients will choose a
node randomly?
2. Does the controller need to support this API? If not, we can drop
"controller" from "listeners."

Thanks,
Jason

On Thu, Nov 16, 2023 at 10:00=E2=80=AFAM Jun Rao <jun@confluent.io.invalid>=
 wrote:

> Hi, Andrew,
>
> Thanks for the KIP. Just one comment.
>
> Should we extend ConfigCommand or add a new tool to list client metrics?
>
> Thanks,
>
> Jun
>
> On Tue, Nov 7, 2023 at 9:42=E2=80=AFAM Andrew Schofield <
> andrew_schofield_jira@outlook.com> wrote:
>
> > Hi,
> > I would like to start discussion of a small KIP which fills a gap in th=
e
> > administration of client metrics configuration.
> >
> >
> >
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1000%3A+List+Client=
+Metrics+Configuration+Resources
> >
> > Thanks,
> > Andrew
>

