Lianet Magrans created KAFKA-15846:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Review consumer leave group request
                 Key: KAFKA-15846
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15846
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Lianet Magrans


New consumer sends out a leave group request with a best effort approach. Transitions to LEAVING to indicate the HB manager that the request must be sent, but it does not do any response handling or retrying. After the first HB manager poll iteration while on LEAVING, the consumer transitions into UNSUBSCRIBE (no matter if the request was actually sent out or not, ex, due to coordinator not known). Review if this is good enough as an effort to send the request.



--
