> [4]
> https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/8aaf7daff393f2b26438fb7fe28016e06e23=
558c/core/src/main/java/kafka/log/remote/RemoteLogReader.java#L68
> [5]
> https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/61fb83e20280ed3ac83de8290dd9815bdb7e=
