Philip Nee created KAFKA-15866:
----------------------------------

             Summary: Refactor OffsetFetchRequestState Error handling to be=
 more consistent with OffsetCommitRequestState
                 Key: KAFKA-15866
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15866
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Philip Nee


The current OffsetFetchRequestState error handling uses nested if-else, whi=
ch is quite different, stylistically, to the OffsetCommitRequestState using=
 a switch statment.=C2=A0 The latter is a bit more readable so we should re=
factor the error handling using the same style to improve readability.

=C2=A0

A minor point: Some of the error handling seems inconsistent with the commi=
t. The logic was from the current implementation, so we should also review =
all the error handling.=C2=A0 For example: somehow the current logic doesn'=
t mark the coordinator unavailable when receiving COORDINATOR_NOT_AVAILABLE



