Lucas Brutschy created KAFKA-15887:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Autocommit during close consistently fails with exception in background thread
                 Key: KAFKA-15887
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15887
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
